=== P1: delta/2 deep-regime mimicry (sympy) ===
  d ln g_obs / d ln f  = (nu(exp(-la + lf + lg)) + exp(-la + lf + lg)*Subs(Derivative(nu(_xi_1), _xi_1), _xi_1, exp(-la + lf + lg)))/nu(exp(-la + lf + lg)) 
  d ln g_obs / d ln a0 = -exp(-la + lf + lg)*Subs(Derivative(nu(_xi_1), _xi_1), _xi_1, exp(-la + lf + lg))/nu(exp(-la + lf + lg)) 
  with m(y) = -dln nu/dln y:  d/dln f = 1 - m ; d/dln a0 = m   (hand-expectation confirmed symbolically above in terms of nu')
